#  MPX NYC: Results {#sec-appendixresults}




## People




### Age {.unnumbered}

::: {.panel-tabset}
#### Bar





```{r plot_bar_age}
#| fig-height: 5
#| fig-width: 4
#| fig-align: center

  targets::tar_read(plotdata_age) |>
    plot_bar() +
    theme_mpxnyc_bar() +
    scale_axis_mpxnyc() +
    scale_fill_mpxnyc(name = "Age group") +
    theme_mpxnyc_nomargin()
```






#### Radar 






```{r plot_radar_age}
#| fig-width: 5
#| fig-height: 5
#| fig-align: center

targets::tar_read(plotdata_age) |>    
  plot_radar_grid()   +
  scale_radial_mpxnyc() +
  scale_fill_mpxnyc(name = "") +
  theme_mpxnyc_radar_people(strip.text = ggplot2::element_blank()) +
  theme_mpxnyc_nomargin()

```







#### Data




```{r table_bar_age}

targets::tar_read(plotdata_age) |>
  draw_table_1("Age")
```




